                  d="M10.5881 12.637L8.38363 11.4347C8.09583 11.7424 7.72213 11.9564 7.3111 12.0489C6.90007 12.1414 6.47072 12.1082 6.07884 11.9534C5.68697 11.7987 5.35069 11.5297 5.11371 11.1814C4.87673 10.833 4.75 10.4215 4.75 10.0002C4.75 9.57885 4.87673 9.16728 5.11371 8.81894C5.35069 8.4706 5.68697 8.20159 6.07884 8.04688C6.47072 7.89217 6.90007 7.8589 7.3111 7.95141C7.72213 8.04392 8.09583 8.25792 8.38363 8.5656L10.5886 7.36335C10.4634 6.86779 10.5233 6.34358 10.757 5.88899C10.9906 5.4344 11.3821 5.08064 11.8579 4.89401C12.3337 4.70739 12.8613 4.70071 13.3417 4.87523C13.8221 5.04976 14.2224 5.39351 14.4675 5.84204C14.7126 6.29057 14.7857 6.81309 14.6731 7.31166C14.5605 7.81023 14.2699 8.25062 13.8558 8.55027C13.4418 8.84993 12.9326 8.98828 12.4238 8.9394C11.915 8.89051 11.4415 8.65774 11.0921 8.28472L8.88711 9.48697C8.97174 9.82369 8.97174 10.1761 8.88711 10.5128L11.0916 11.7151C11.441 11.3421 11.9145 11.1093 12.4233 11.0604C12.9321 11.0115 13.4412 11.1499 13.8553 11.4495C14.2694 11.7492 14.56 12.1896 14.6726 12.6881C14.7852 13.1867 14.7121 13.7092 14.467 14.1578C14.2219 14.6063 13.8216 14.95 13.3412 15.1246C12.8608 15.2991 12.3332 15.2924 11.8574 15.1058C11.3815 14.9192 10.9901 14.5654 10.7564 14.1108C10.5228 13.6562 10.4629 13.132 10.5881 12.6364V12.637ZM6.85011 11.0499C7.12859 11.0499 7.39566 10.9393 7.59257 10.7424C7.78948 10.5454 7.90011 10.2784 7.90011 9.9999C7.90011 9.72142 7.78948 9.45435 7.59257 9.25744C7.39566 9.06052 7.12859 8.9499 6.85011 8.9499C6.57163 8.9499 6.30456 9.06052 6.10765 9.25744C5.91073 9.45435 5.80011 9.72142 5.80011 9.9999C5.80011 10.2784 5.91073 10.5454 6.10765 10.7424C6.30456 10.9393 6.57163 11.0499 6.85011 11.0499ZM12.6251 7.8999C12.9036 7.8999 13.1707 7.78927 13.3676 7.59236C13.5645 7.39545 13.6751 7.12838 13.6751 6.8499C13.6751 6.57142 13.5645 6.30435 13.3676 6.10744C13.1707 5.91052 12.9036 5.7999 12.6251 5.7999C12.3466 5.7999 12.0796 5.91052 11.8826 6.10744C11.6857 6.30435 11.5751 6.57142 11.5751 6.8499C11.5751 7.12838 11.6857 7.39545 11.8826 7.59236C12.0796 7.78927 12.3466 7.8999 12.6251 7.8999ZM12.6251 14.1999C12.9036 14.1999 13.1707 14.0893 13.3676 13.8924C13.5645 13.6954 13.6751 13.4284 13.6751 13.1499C13.6751 12.8714 13.5645 12.6044 13.3676 12.4074C13.1707 12.2105 12.9036 12.0999 12.6251 12.0999C12.3466 12.0999 12.0796 12.2105 11.8826 12.4074C11.6857 12.6044 11.5751 12.8714 11.5751 13.1499C11.5751 13.4284 11.6857 13.6954 11.8826 13.8924C12.0796 14.0893 12.3466 14.1999 12.6251 14.1999Z"
